@v396 kernel.seq.make item "A finite introductory vocabulary, not a complete school curriculum." item "Rules describe explicit taxonomic categories, not default abilities or living status. No universal bird-flight or mammal-live-birth rule is supplied." item "General conversation, pronouns, flexible paraphrases, temporal change and unrestricted why/how explanations are not learned by these data." item "Unit counts are declared exact duration facts, not a general unit-conversion solver." item "What-is answers select supported category names. They are not free-form generated definitions." item "Category definitions and instance classification share an explicit kind relation. The vocabulary separates category constants from ordinary named examples by teaching convention, not a general higher-order type system." item "Source citations support the authored claims; the formal proof checker verifies entailment and spans, not external source truth." item "The optional initializer is explicit and must be used through a model-bound session snapshot until a shared fact-fragments bootstrap linkage is installed." item "Geography includes two countries and their capitals. It does not claim worldwide coverage or political-border reasoning."
